{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>每次上高速，總會遇到這麼幾個跑賊拉慢的，還硬要和貨車肩並肩。明明咱們都是速成車，為啥就你開這麼慢啊？</strong>如果交警們能管管這些龜速車，那馬路肯定和吃了一斤瀉藥一樣，暢通多了。但這個的前提是，龜速車到底違不違法？</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583656.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.449918+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:11:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"e4bbd158a5e734d95514c1ac99d391da7cce44663f73f4e6570b551823c796e5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}